{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3f0fe66b9386c014e280a67e77b443580d5982520ce890e2a44c1fe45b1ba821", "ja": "歩がスタジオに戻る途中、真が走ってくる。\nスタッフより先に、まず歩と話すべきだった\nと言う真に、ハッとする歩。そうだ、この曲\nはふたりの曲……そう気付いたふたりは、ダ\nーン！　と拳を重ねるのだった。", "zh": "步回工作室的途中，真跑了过来。\n真说，自己本该先和步谈谈，而不是去找工作人员，步听后猛然醒悟。没错，这首歌是属于两人的歌……意识到这一点的两人，便“砰！”地碰了碰拳头。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_05_1000_034ayu", "source_sha256": "44910edd20af3e7f468539f1d7f96bc3f05f298c188732e676e529137adf5faf", "ja": "早く戻って、話さないとな。\n……だ、大丈夫。通訳さんだっているし、うん……。", "zh": "得赶紧回去聊聊才行。\n……没、没关系。不是还有翻译在嘛，嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_05_1001_006mak", "source_sha256": "397d31256da054b2b703302269a4c3a3300399a4c453a8e9542bf720eb7004bc", "ja": "いたいた、歩ー！\nはあ……会えて良かったー！", "zh": "找到了找到了，步——！\n哈啊……能见到你太好了——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_05_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b0e94b09850e760971fa4e509bc8bf94c2cbb23e313736acfe55d725efd521a9", "ja": "えっ、真！？　な、なんでここにいるの？\nレコーディングはー？", "zh": "咦，真！？你、你怎么会在这里？\n录音呢——？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_05_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "15d4df6ee338d091151f06b549f85b13bda18a3d048673fcf3af18a42640f3a8", "ja": "ちょっと抜けてきたんだ。\nだって、レコーディングの前にやることがあったから！", "zh": "我抽空出来了一下。\n因为在录音之前，还有件事要做！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_05_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "dcc2984cd72cd5a624468681ff3912ca14c2b3a1777eaef364a5f17c52b985a3", "ja": "……ごめん、歩！　スタッフさんと話すより、\n先に、歩と話すべきだったんだよね！", "zh": "……对不起，步！比起和工作人员聊天，\n我应该先和你说话的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_05_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b252853cad92903cf1fe1676f3f93de46af626d40837c9733fd670602fb4f3fd", "ja": "アタシと？　なんで？", "zh": "和我？为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_05_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "dc3de5d37299195d4e8c12f5ca2fcd2b3fdf11980c4082ff03d2dfed5b832709", "ja": "この曲は、ボクと歩……ふたりの曲だろう？\nどちらかが欠けてちゃダメだったんだ。", "zh": "这首歌，是我和步……我们两个人的歌吧？\n少了谁都不行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_05_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b720114637e3f2a54d0e747e41a48d051fcf943b790d1db82070b6aa87c73b2d", "ja": "ふたりの……あっ。そうだ……そうだよ！\nアタシ、真とも話せてない……話してない！", "zh": "我们的……啊，对了……就是这样！\n我都没能和真好好说上话……根本没说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_05_1008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "cc8e9468f18546db8924b2ec90a2fe86a6bc58f522930221d9dcbd75a1b6bfe4", "ja": "ううっ、ゴメン真！　アタシなんか、勝手に\nテンパっちゃって。自分のことばっかで……。", "zh": "呜呜，对不起，真！我居然自顾自地\n慌了手脚，光顾着自己的事了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_05_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "ccfab30526db179664fe444d2fe65d84e1b70a1a38c595a4153e63c61795ed97", "ja": "それは、ボクも同じだよ。\n本当に海外旅行気分で、浮かれちゃってたと思う……。", "zh": "那样的话，我也一样。\n我觉得自己真的像是在海外旅行一样，兴奋过头了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_05_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c4a72902832c4e7828f3a4a8a9cadc504f53c0c2a4727c0443551c633fa08fe0", "ja": "そんなことないよ！　真はちゃんとやってたよ！\nアタシがダメダメだっただけで……。", "zh": "才不是那样！真一直都做得很好！\n只是我自己太差劲了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_05_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "464ca304f959fe06d8e9b40badb96f301b80957985e2e31af6f4b0b6ef23f4e4", "ja": "ああ、もう！　{$P$}は、\nなんでアタシを真のパートナーに選んだんだろう……。", "zh": "啊，真是的！{$P$}为什么会选我当真的搭档呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_05_1012_006mak", "source_sha256": "19be9f0c0c9c999e54e2ddc0b652cad0db76e58710898c84a25cc151a8d9432b", "ja": "あっ。それは……\n歩とやりたいって、ボクが言ったからなんだ。", "zh": "啊。那个……\n是我跟他说想和步一起搭档的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_05_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c63e8532fb4e06d40c0f9e9ec10d2581e17febe12331d6796dd9d1f63fad2559", "ja": "……え？　……ええっ、真が！？", "zh": "……哎？　……哎哎！？真指名的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_05_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "764474c86521ba08274e88f7e6f7c7edf34db57d00ec3d26d75787891730a67c", "ja": "うん。誰と歌いたい？って聞かれて。\nじゃあ歩がいいです、って。", "zh": "嗯。被问到“想和谁一起唱？”之后，\n我就说了“那就选步吧”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_05_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "504aa104c645eb29b77442efe45598323d1cd7666319b6f3c4f292390ce17d80", "ja": "な……なんで？　ワールドワイドなユニットなら、\nエミリーとか、それこそエレナの方がいいだろ？", "zh": "为……为什么？如果是面向全世界的组合，那不是艾米莉，或者说艾蕾娜更合适吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_05_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "79fc8c1c6a8642622d8ddf85a72fad90ee644d9d0e14905c281b370f08813ec5", "ja": "パフォーマンスでいったら、美希や響だって……。\nあーダメだ！　アタシ、めんどくさいヤツになってる！", "zh": "要说表演的话，美希和响也……。\n啊——不行！我怎么变成这么难搞的人了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_05_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "ada3d46e57736476c7661bcabcea455fa642e2cd6b3d528eef908748e371fe1c", "ja": "うーん、なんでって言われても困るけど……。\n歩が頼りになるからかな？", "zh": "嗯——你问我为什么，我也很难回答……  \n大概是因为步很可靠吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_05_1018_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a9f3f4e6b396ec25d206c2fcc7b1ed8facc191cdc306ca072a44cf760a8f2ed2", "ja": "……アタシが？", "zh": "……我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_05_1019_006mak", "source_sha256": "c73b2900346163b0461c8c0cf0a0b16722b816cac11600446b42b49b4494d03a", "ja": "うん！　ボクは「世界を目指す！」って言われて、\n正直、すっごく不安になったんだ。", "zh": "嗯！听到你说“要以世界为目标！”时，说实话，我特别不安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_05_1020_006mak", "source_sha256": "d4bedb0779d361802d7e59e0c3661212f88fdfa2aec6835d2698f86c40939920", "ja": "当たり前だと思うんだよね。アイドルしてるって\nいっても、もとは普通の高校生だもん、ボク。", "zh": "我觉得这也很正常啦。虽然说是当了偶像，\n但我本来也只是个普通的高中生嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_05_1021_006mak", "source_sha256": "2fe13b4e4c41396b905cf178a58826a2f8eb4bc6a3c5ca52491cd889f4168ac3", "ja": "でも、歩は違った。アイドルになる前から世界を見て、\n飛び込んでた。……そんな人、他にいないよ。", "zh": "但是，步不一样。还没成为偶像之前，她就已经在观察世界，并投身其中了。……这样的人，再也找不到第二个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_05_1022_034ayu", "source_sha256": "cea3957c3dc65429de8756c2f3fcecbf63099921ac921a4631143dfdd77b9aa6", "ja": "真……。", "zh": "真……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_05_1023_006mak", "source_sha256": "0d4bc2c0d622374f063b8e2babf2e3ee01eadaebaf18c48701941e070b4ef77d", "ja": "この際だから言っちゃうけど……ボクは歩のこと、\n尊敬してるんだ。今回組めたのも、すごくうれしい！", "zh": "既然都到这个时候了，我就直说了……我很尊敬步。 这次能和她组队，我也特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_05_1024_006mak", "source_sha256": "1f25fcd7f36bd4533e5343a7a733ce203efd928fb2bbcb3a93d41a98f4f2e38e", "ja": "だから、一緒にこの歌を歌っていきたいって、\n思ってるんだけど……。もしかして、迷惑だった？", "zh": "所以，我想和你一起唱这首歌……不过，该不会给你添麻烦了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_05_1025_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4fb0adcdb723bacce2c300d0139b30f6c4866cf6c138f486382de635f46fe142", "ja": "そんなことないよ！　尊敬してるのはアタシの方だし！\n真は言葉が通じなくても堂々と話せるし、歌えるし……", "zh": "才不是那样！应该是我更尊敬你才对！\n就算语言不通，真也能堂堂正正地说话、唱歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_05_1026_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8087e9c53f0be111c4035baf225df3e66fa319c8e212c5d69ceb2ecf0dc0f2ac", "ja": "アタシに、そんなこと……\nいってくれるし……ぐすっ。", "zh": "你居然对我说这种话……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_05_1027_006mak", "source_sha256": "1735f7f425d7ace0ef0a82d3e1b0d18ac37702359dce8fe43e66362856705e73", "ja": "うわ、歩！？\nなんかボク、デリカシーのないこと言っちゃった？", "zh": "哇，步！？\n我是不是说了什么欠考虑的话？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_05_1028_034ayu", "source_sha256": "15880a0b2612ef8837c3c5b78455307d22008ce3a8a3fba9d8e6fe28b7ddc868", "ja": "逆だよ、逆！　うれしくて……。へへっ。\nうん、大丈夫！　ありがとね、真！", "zh": "反了，反了！我是高兴……嘿嘿。\n嗯，没事！谢谢你，真！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_05_1029_034ayu", "source_sha256": "020a37310b3dca6689d70a4f7ded6ac7d7a1bb85e3f8d39d507084b0996b7d3b", "ja": "真のおかげで……ううん、みんなのおかげで、\nなんかアタシ、バッチリ歌える気がしてきた！", "zh": "多亏了真……不，是多亏了大家，我好像已经有信心把歌唱好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_05_1030_034ayu", "source_sha256": "44bf24318267bcbc7fbe5f2e49ed0a276c1bb6405117aa2d614c609623af71c6", "ja": "ホント、ひとりで空回りして、なにやってたんだろ。\nなんか、めちゃくちゃ恥ずかしいよ！", "zh": "真的，我一个人瞎忙活，到底在干什么啊。\n感觉好丢脸啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_05_1031_006mak", "source_sha256": "8e7b00de900ed14f13ddfc0090bf4f20acbbf8358e07c48886f8312c616434ba", "ja": "ボクだって同じだよ。歩と歌いたくて来たのに……。\n最初からもっと話しておけばよかった。", "zh": "我也是一样啊。明明是想和步一起唱歌才来的……  \n要是一开始就多聊聊就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_05_1032_006mak", "source_sha256": "27c71cbd0e8da5ad0a54596d6ddeb4cb56167bc5650142c3fc0ce10f674b835e", "ja": "でも、まだ時間はあるよね！\nこれからみんなで話して、いい曲にしよう！", "zh": "不过，我们还有时间，对吧！\n接下来大家一起商量，把它变成一首好歌吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_05_1033_034ayu", "source_sha256": "56a913bc2e825f47cdbaa9579da1bb9ce8e7685417b53fc4e1875ad426a3a0d7", "ja": "うん、そうだね！\nアタシも、迷惑かけちゃった分、頑張らないと！", "zh": "嗯，没错！\n我也得为给大家添了麻烦，好好加油才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_05_1034_006mak", "source_sha256": "633d199f4d9ad2c3f96a3a32742325eeda6fa473e21c5f05d3001bfff4b4f9b5", "ja": "あ、そうだ。\nねえ歩、右手貸してくれない？", "zh": "啊，对了。\n呐，步，能把右手借给我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
